SM 5193, KoMAc1)\n\nBacterial strain\n\n# Acetobacterium sp. (DSM 5193, KoMAc1)\n\nBacDive ID 5404\n\nType strain\n\nStrain Designation KoMAc1\n\nCulture col. no. DSM 5193 KoMAc1\n\nNCBI tax ID(s) 1872094\n\nSpecial Collections DSMZ\n\nHistory DSMZ <- B. Schink, Eberhard-Karls-Universität Tübingen, Tübingen, Germany; KoMAc1 <- B. Schuppert; {1988}\n\n\nKoMAc1 is an anaerobe bacterium that was isolated from anoxic sewage sludge.\n\nanaerobe Bacteria\n\n## Name and taxonomic classification\n\nSI-ID 47902\n\nDSM 5193\n\n@ref 20215\nLast LPSN update 2026-05-29 08:26:10\nDomain Bacteria\nPhylum Bacillota\nClass Clostridia\nOrder Eubacteriales\nFamily Eubacteriaceae\nGenus Acetobacterium\nFull scientific name Acetobacterium Balch et al. 1977 (Approved Lists 1980)\n\n## Morphology\n\n## Culture and growth conditions\n\n### Culture medium\n\n@ref  | Name  | Growth  | Medium link  | Composition  | \n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\n1907  | DESULFOBULBUS SP. MEDIUM (FRESHWATER) (DSMZ Medium 194)  |  | Medium recipe at MediaDive  | Name: DESULFOBULBUS SP. MEDIUM (FRESHWATER) (DSMZ Medium 194; with strain-specific modifications) Composition: Na2SO4 2.99103 g/l Na2CO3 1.49551 g/l NaCl 0.997009 g/l None 0.897308 g/l KCl 0.498504 g/l Yeast extract 0.498504 g/l Na2S x 9 H2O 0.398804 g/l MgCl2 x 6 H2O 0.398804 g/l NH4Cl 0.299103 g/l KH2PO4 0.199402 g/l CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.149551 g/l HCl 0.00249252 g/l FeCl2 x 4 H2O 0.00149551 g/l NaOH 0.000498504 g/l Sodium resazurin 0.000498504 g/l CoCl2 x 6 H2O 0.000189432 g/l Pyridoxine hydrochloride 9.97009e-05 g/l MnCl2 x 4 H2O 9.97009e-05 g/l ZnCl2 6.97906e-05 g/l Calcium D-(+)-pantothenate 4.98504e-05 g/l Nicotinic acid 4.98504e-05 g/l (DL)-alpha-Lipoic acid 4.98504e-05 g/l Riboflavin 4.98504e-05 g/l p-Aminobenzoic acid 4.98504e-05 g/l Thiamine HCl 4.98504e-05 g/l Na2MoO4 x 2 H2O 3.58923e-05 g/l NiCl2 x 6 H2O 2.39282e-05 g/l Biotin 1.99402e-05 g/l Folic acid 1.99402e-05 g/l H3BO3 5.98205e-06 g/l Na2WO4 x 2 H2O 3.98804e-06 g/l Na2SeO3 x 5 H2O 2.